engine/d3_contract.py vendors the prompt/answer contract of vllm-sr/d3 (Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 vLLM Semantic Router
Team; upstream/d3/LICENSE and NOTICE). Built on Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B (Apache-2.0).

engine/backends/vllm_readout.py reimplements, for serving through vLLM, the Quyet prompt v2 and question parsing of the `quyet`
package (Apache License 2.0, "Quyet by Chinh Nguyen", https://huggingface.co/chinhnc/Quyet-1.0-Large; keep that NOTICE when
redistributing the model) and the Surogate decisions v1 prompt of the reference Rune adapter (model: surogate/rune-26b-a4b, derived
from Google Gemma 4, Apache License 2.0). No weights are included.

Plumb-4B (s1-fast): engine/plumb_engine.py serves crh225/plumb-4b (Apache License 2.0; Qwen3.5-4B base, Apache License 2.0;
author's JevK5 runtime and calibration by alibiserikbay, Apache License 2.0). The decision prompt and readout in
engine/plumb_engine.py (payload layout, system instruction, option lettering, calibration temperature use) are adapted from
the author's jevk5/runtime.py (https://github.com/allebee/jevk5, Apache License 2.0), which follows SemIf (MIT).
Modifications: the chat template is rendered as a plain string and tokenised with the Rust tokenizer (token ids verified
identical), and the forward pass is the packed varlen engine of engine/pplx_engine.py.
Model weights are NOT included in any image or source tree.
